{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Thief\u2019s Riddles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The main character of the game is a professional thief.</strong> <br>During one of his heists, he was betrayed and ended up in police custody. To avoid spending many years behind bars, the police offered him a deal: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0The thief must rob various criminals who are untouchable by law due to lack of evidence or the inability to obtain search warrants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission is to steal valuable items, evidence, and documents that will help put these criminals behind bars for many years.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the game, you\u2019ll experience:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various locations and missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of puzzles and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse criminals, each with their own secrets and paranoia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging stealth gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A range of enemies: criminals, insane homeowners, guard dogs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re working undercover, so to the police, you\u2019re just a regular thief</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716670?t=1759948109","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716670/d53a02e04193e67bfed43a55d3cb860a09b71674/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759948109","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716670/3ff88db3262a81341d8593debbeb458a62d94325/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759948109","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716670/3ff88db3262a81341d8593debbeb458a62d94325/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759948109","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Thief\u2019s Riddles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The main character of the game is a professional thief.</strong> <br>During one of his heists, he was betrayed and ended up in police custody. To avoid spending many years behind bars, the police offered him a deal: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0The thief must rob various criminals who are untouchable by law due to lack of evidence or the inability to obtain search warrants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission is to steal valuable items, evidence, and documents that will help put these criminals behind bars for many years.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the game, you\u2019ll experience:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various locations and missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of puzzles and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse criminals, each with their own secrets and paranoia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging stealth gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A range of enemies: criminals, insane homeowners, guard dogs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re working undercover, so to the police, you\u2019re just a regular thief</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more...</p></li></ul>","developers":[" SP GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716670/71345ed72ed4ea5a3014f336d8399a85208f2c45/header.jpg?t=1759948109","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3716670/2142064101/eba3395b